    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark and realistic ocean setting, you are the last hope. As a Coast Guard rescue swimmer, you'll face the ocean's fury and make the agonizing choices that define who lives and who dies. Search sinking vessels, battle monstrous waves, and endure the chilling grip of hypothermia. Your decisions have consequences, and every rescue is a gamble against the relentless sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/f325fa014711a50022966cf64c7bce4a.avif?t=1743876111\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the chilling grip of hypothermia as you battle to find and rescue survivors from the raging depths. Every second counts in this desperate struggle against the elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/7a18e90e8cb3442451afb2736739bccd.poster.avif?t=1743876111\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/7a18e90e8cb3442451afb2736739bccd.webm?t=1743876111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/7a18e90e8cb3442451afb2736739bccd.mp4?t=1743876111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/53f24dac50e3e4fc1500ab9ed621f5a3.avif?t=1743876111\" width=723 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defying the elements, one wave at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/da979a76bf10729e3c14ac46fea2f66c.avif?t=1743876111\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Coast Guard rescue swimmer, you will experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ocean Waves:</strong> Master the surging tides! Each wave is a dynamic obstacle in your path.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Searching for Survivors:</strong> Scan the chaos and locate the lost souls before they vanish beneath the waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hypothermia:</strong> Fight the freeze! Every second counts for you and the survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carrying Survivors and Loading the Basket:</strong> Strength and precision! Haul survivors through the chaos and secure them for airlift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coordinating and Strategizing:</strong> Coordinate through radio with the chopper team to navigate the storm and extract survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ Handcrafted Maps:</strong> Explore diverse dangers. Each map is a unique gauntlet testing your rescue skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Much More:</strong> Face unexpected threats. The ocean holds countless challenges for the ultimate rescue swimmer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark and realistic ocean setting, you are the last hope. As a Coast Guard rescue swimmer, you'll face the ocean's fury and make the agonizing choices that define who lives and who dies. Search sinking vessels, battle monstrous waves, and endure the chilling grip of hypothermia. Your decisions have consequences, and every rescue is a gamble against the relentless sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/f325fa014711a50022966cf64c7bce4a.avif?t=1743876111\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the chilling grip of hypothermia as you battle to find and rescue survivors from the raging depths. Every second counts in this desperate struggle against the elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/7a18e90e8cb3442451afb2736739bccd.poster.avif?t=1743876111\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/7a18e90e8cb3442451afb2736739bccd.webm?t=1743876111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/7a18e90e8cb3442451afb2736739bccd.mp4?t=1743876111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/53f24dac50e3e4fc1500ab9ed621f5a3.avif?t=1743876111\" width=723 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defying the elements, one wave at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588620/extras/da979a76bf10729e3c14ac46fea2f66c.avif?t=1743876111\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Coast Guard rescue swimmer, you will experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ocean Waves:</strong> Master the surging tides! Each wave is a dynamic obstacle in your path.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Searching for Survivors:</strong> Scan the chaos and locate the lost souls before they vanish beneath the waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hypothermia:</strong> Fight the freeze! Every second counts for you and the survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carrying Survivors and Loading the Basket:</strong> Strength and precision! Haul survivors through the chaos and secure them for airlift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coordinating and Strategizing:</strong> Coordinate through radio with the chopper team to navigate the storm and extract survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ Handcrafted Maps:</strong> Explore diverse dangers. Each map is a unique gauntlet testing your rescue skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Much More:</strong> Face unexpected threats. The ocean holds countless challenges for the ultimate rescue swimmer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Brave storm-lashed seas as a Coast Guard swimmer. Plunge from choppers, swim through swells, search sinking ships, strategize rescues, and ultimately decide who lives and who dies in the dark, icy, unforgiving ocean.",
